{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107679","id":2602740921,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bIqy5","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107679","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107679.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107679.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107679","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107679/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107679/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107679/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/86e1ce7bf7f890ccfe41ffdb43a5216e4933a408","number":107679,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Set audiostreamplayer default area_mask to 0 and exit early to reduce performance overhead.","user":{"login":"pirey0","id":38705070,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NzA1MDcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38705070?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirey0","html_url":"https://github.com/pirey0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirey0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirey0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirey0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirey0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirey0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirey0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirey0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirey0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirey0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #106751 \r\n\r\nQuick summary:\r\nBy default AudioStreamPlayers2D/3D do a physics check on their position every frame when running to support the audio_bus_override feature on Area2D/3D. \r\n\r\nFrom my search this is a feature that is rarely used, but results in a non negligible overhead for all projects, even if the feature is never used.\r\n\r\nI propose setting the default area_mask to 0 and exiting early in those scenarios to remove this overhead.\r\n\r\n#### Reasons:\r\n 1. Most projects don't use this feature and should thus not be affected by the cost.\r\n 2. A default of 0 (aka. no overlap) more closely aligns with the opt-in nature of the feature. \r\n I think the default of 1 (aka. check for overlaps with all default areas) is more likely to cause unexpected behaviour.\r\n3. Most projects using this feature will very likely be using a specific non-1 layer for this effect and will thus be unaffected by the change.\r\n\r\n#### Warning:\r\nThis PR includes a Behavior Breaking Change:\r\nProjects using the audio_bus_override feature on the default layer will find their overrides not working anymore.\r\n(Though I expect this number to be very low, can do a targeted search if required)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/pe